{"kind":"stack","id":"s1","title":"How water travels inside plants","theme":{"background":"#f4fbf4","foreground":"#1d3b1d","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"tree"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"Which tubes carry water up from the roots to the leaves?"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"Xylem","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Phloem","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"Stomata","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Xylem"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"Xylem is a set of tubes that carries water and minerals from the roots up through the stem to the leaves."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which force pulls water up through the plant as it evaporates from the leaves?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Transpiration","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Photosynthesis","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Germination","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Where does water mainly leave a plant?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Through tiny holes in the leaves","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Through the roots","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Through the flower petals only","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"Phloem"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-e","content":"Phloem is a set of tubes that carries food made in the leaves down to the rest of the plant."},{"type":"button","id":"c5-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-q","content":"Which part of the plant takes in most of the water?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"The roots","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"The flowers","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-c","label":"The seeds","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"A plant in your classroom is wilting. What do you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"Give it a drink of water","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Move it into the sun and wait","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"The water travels up the xylem and the plant stands up tall again. Well done!"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"Without water, the plant stays wilted and the leaves dry out. Try watering it next time."},{"type":"button","id":"c9-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"What is the main job of the stem in carrying water?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"It carries water up to the leaves","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"It stores sunlight for the roots","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"It makes the seeds grow","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"You finished the water in plants quiz!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Well done. You now know how water travels from the roots to the leaves."}],"actions":[]}}
